#. module: app_builder_approval
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/app_builder_approval/models/builder_approval_surface.py:0
msgid ""
"Removing a rule takes it out of security/%s_approval.xml; approvals already "
"in flight are untouched."
msgstr ""

#. module: app_builder_approval
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/app_builder_approval/models/builder_approval.py:0
msgid ""
"Rules you create here are written into your builder package, so they ship "
"with the rest of your customisation."
msgstr ""

#. module: app_builder_approval
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/app_builder_approval/models/builder_approval.py:0
msgid ""
"Say which state needs approving into. This engine gates a state change, not "
"a button, so a rule with no destination has nothing to attach to."
msgstr ""

#. module: app_builder_approval
#. odoo-javascript
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/app_builder_approval/models/builder_approval.py:0
#: code:addons/app_builder_approval/static/src/console_items.js:0
msgid "Say who must approve, and in what order"
msgstr ""

#. module: app_builder_approval
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/app_builder_approval/models/builder_approval_surface.py:0
msgid ""
"Takes the tier.validation mixin, its configuration and the creation guard "
"back out of the model's class in the package; one reload. The approval rules"
" stay as they are and never fire with no gate; the reviews already asked for"
" stay in their history. The validation status column the gate added is the "
"only stored field removed, and its values are kept under a renamed column, "
"as for any confirmed removal. Anything else waiting to be removed from the "
"package is not confirmed by this and still has to be applied on its own."
msgstr ""

#. module: app_builder_approval
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/app_builder_approval/models/builder_approval.py:0
msgid ""
"The values of %(field)s cannot be listed, so there is no way to make sure "
"approval is asked on every way into %(to)s. Gate a stored selection field "
"whose values are fixed."
msgstr ""

#. module: app_builder_approval
#: model:ir.model,name:app_builder_approval.model_tier_definition
msgid "Tier Definition"
msgstr ""

#. module: app_builder_approval
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/app_builder_approval/models/builder_approval.py:0
msgid "Unknown model '%s'."
msgstr ""

#. module: app_builder_approval
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/app_builder_approval/models/builder_approval_surface.py:0
msgid ""
"Writes the tier.validation mixin into the model's class in the package; one "
"reload. Approval is asked for on every way into the states you pick -- from "
"any other state, including one added later, and for a record created, "
"imported or duplicated already in one -- because the status field is an "
"ordinary writable field and a gate on one path only would be walked round. "
"Rules decide who approves; with no rule, nothing is asked."
msgstr ""

